#
# Ownership, used for review routing and attribution.
#
# This file does not by itself stop a contribution weakening the rules that
# govern it. That is enforced by .gitlocus/policy.yml, which holds the privileged
# paths listed below to maintainer standing. The branch ruleset has no path
# restrictions, and a comment here once said it did.

# Everything, by default.
*                       @1xmint

# The highest-leverage paths in the repository. CI decides what every other
# check is worth, and the policy decides what CI is for.
/.github/               @1xmint
/.gitlocus/             @1xmint

# The contract other implementations code against.
/spec/                  @1xmint

# Documents that state what this project promises.
/SECURITY.md            @1xmint
/THREAT-MODEL.md        @1xmint
/LICENSE                @1xmint
/NOTICE                 @1xmint
